# The frontend holds no secrets. The RAGFlow beta token and bot ids live in
# the backend (../myui-backend/.env); the browser only reaches the backend
# through the Vite /bff proxy in local dev.
#
# --- Deployed builds ---
# Absolute origin of the backend (BFF), e.g. https://backend.example.com. Set it
# as a build-time environment variable (NOT here) — Vite inlines it at build
# time. Leave it UNSET for local dev so the Vite /bff proxy is used.
#   VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://backend.example.com
#
# Optional: override the backend path prefix (defaults to /bff).
# VITE_BFF_BASE=/bff
